    'Clips start several times faster: the video comes as one ready file with real seeking, instead of being glued together by FFmpeg on the fly': '音乐视频打开速度快了好几倍：视频以一个支持真实拖动的完整文件送达，而不是由 FFmpeg 临时拼接',
    'A clip weighs much less — the height is capped the way YouTube does it, and Auto picks the quality from the real size of the frame': '音乐视频体积小了很多——画面高度按 YouTube 的方式限制，“自动”根据画面的实际大小选择清晰度',
    'The next clip from the queue is warmed up in the background, so it opens almost instantly': '队列中的下一个音乐视频会在后台预热，所以几乎瞬间打开',
    'Clip not found is shown at once: the answer about a missing video is remembered and no longer waits for a failed playback attempt': '会立即显示“找不到音乐视频”：缺失视频的结果会被记住，不再等待一次失败的播放尝试',
    'Space pauses the clip, and the music behind the clip screen is left alone': '空格键暂停音乐视频，视频画面后面的音乐不再受影响',
    'Clip keys: arrows — 5 seconds, J and L — 10 seconds, digits — jump, F — full screen, M — mute, N — next clip': '音乐视频快捷键：方向键 — 5 秒，J 和 L — 10 秒，数字键 — 跳转，F — 全屏，M — 静音，N — 下一个视频',
    'The clip screen has its own controls: a timeline with the buffered part, time, volume, picture in picture and full screen, and the panel hides itself while the video plays': '音乐视频画面有自己的控件：带缓冲进度的时间轴、时间、音量、画中画和全屏，播放时面板会自动隐藏',
    'Video sections by topic: the queue, this artist, related clips, new releases, popular now and genre collections': '按主题划分的视频栏目：队列、这位艺人、相关视频、新歌、当前热门和流派合集',
    'The list of past releases here is cleared — only the current version is left': '这里的历史版本列表已清空——只保留当前版本',
