    'Karaoke follows the words, not the lines: the line fills along with the voice, word after word, and can be switched back in Settings → Karaoke': '卡拉OK 跟随单词而不是整行：歌词随人声逐词填充，可在“设置 → 卡拉OK”中切回以前的方式',
    'Crossfade instead of fade-out: the next track rises while the current one falls, with no gap of silence between them, exactly as a Spotify crossfade works': '交叉淡化代替淡出：当前曲目渐弱时下一首渐强，中间没有静音空隙——和 Spotify 的交叉淡化完全一样',
    'Wallpapers work at last — the opaque background of the page was painting over the wallpaper layer, so a file, a link, a pattern or the current cover simply never showed up': '壁纸终于生效了：页面的不透明背景盖住了壁纸层，所以文件、链接、图案或当前封面一直显示不出来',
    'Cards no longer shiver under the cursor: nothing moves on hover any more, so the hover can no longer fall off and come back dozens of times a second': '卡片在光标下不再抖动：悬停时不再有任何移动，悬停状态也就不会每秒丢失又恢复几十次',
    'Colour correction for any theme: hue, saturation, brightness, warmth, panels, borders, text contrast, glow and shadows — twelve sliders on top of any palette': '适用于任何主题的色彩校正：色相、饱和度、亮度、色温、面板、边框、文字对比度、光晕和阴影——在任何配色上叠加十二个滑块',
    'A theme can be shared: Export writes the whole look into one small .kryonyx-theme.json file, Import loads a friend\'s file back exactly': '主题可以分享：“导出”把整体外观写入一个小小的 .kryonyx-theme.json 文件，“导入”能原样载入朋友发来的文件',
    'Search across all settings: one field instead of remembering which of the sixteen panes a switch lives in': '在所有设置中搜索：一个搜索框，不用再记某个开关在十六个面板中的哪一个',
    'Settings look tidier: every setting is its own card, sections are marked with a coloured tick and the active pane with a bar': '设置看起来更整洁：每项设置都是独立卡片，分区带彩色标记，当前面板带一条竖条',
    'A narrow window no longer piles the icons on top of each other: the player sits above the bottom menu, and extra buttons step aside instead of overlapping': '窄窗口不再把图标挤成一堆：播放器位于底部菜单上方，多余的按钮会让开而不是互相重叠',
    'Discord settings are much wider: the kind of status, your own templates for both lines, the artwork caption, the text while paused and a clickable button under the card': 'Discord 设置大大扩展：状态类型、两行文字的自定义模板、封面说明、暂停时的文字，以及卡片下方的可点击按钮',
    'The Russian interface is translated in full': '俄语界面已完整翻译',
    'The drawn style is called Original and Original at night — no more Saba in the names': '手绘风格改名为“原版”和“原版·夜间”——名称里不再有 Saba',
    'The logo is gone from the window title bar': '窗口标题栏中的徽标已移除',
