    'paste the cookies by hand. In your browser open youtube.com while signed in, export the cookies with any “cookies.txt” extension (or copy the whole': '手动粘贴 cookies。在浏览器中登录后打开 youtube.com，用任意“cookies.txt”扩展导出 cookies（或从 F12 → Network 复制完整的',
    'request header from F12 → Network) and paste them below.': '请求头），然后粘贴到下方。',
    'and paste them below. The Cookie line must be included. Your password never leaves your browser, and the keys are stored only on this computer.': '并粘贴到下方。必须包含 Cookie 这一行。你的密码不会离开浏览器，密钥只保存在这台电脑上。',
    'in your browser and make sure you are signed in.': '并确认已登录。',
