    '. The app shows a short code and a link: open the link in your browser, sign in to your Google account and enter the code. The password never goes through the player, and the token is stored only on this computer.': '。应用会显示一个短代码和一个链接：在浏览器中打开链接，登录你的 Google 账号并输入代码。密码不会经过播放器，令牌只保存在这台电脑上。',
