    'A six-band equalizer in Settings → Sound, with presets and a curve you can drag; it is stored on this device and stays until you change it again': '“设置 → 声音”中的六段均衡器，带预设和可拖动的曲线；保存在本设备上，在你再次修改前一直保持',
    'Themes finally change the background: the karaoke scene and the light themes take their colour from the chosen palette instead of a hardcoded near-black': '主题终于会改变背景：卡拉OK 场景和浅色主题会采用所选配色的颜色，而不是写死的近黑色',
