    'Disc mode settings: lyrics sync, layout, jewel case / bare disc / vinyl, size, spin speed, glow, grain, vignette and reflection': '光盘模式设置：歌词同步、布局、CD 盒 / 裸盘 / 黑胶、大小、旋转速度、光晕、颗粒、暗角和倒影',
    'Scene buttons in Disc mode are real round buttons with like, tap-sync and close': '光盘模式的场景按钮变成真正的圆形按钮：喜欢、点按同步和关闭',
