    'A VPN that works for the whole computer (WireGuard, OpenVPN, WARP and so on) needs no setup here: just turn it on, the player goes through it.': '覆盖整台电脑的 VPN（WireGuard、OpenVPN、WARP 等）无需在此设置：只要打开它，播放器就会自动通过它联网。',
    'Confirm the code in your browser — the player will notice it itself': '请在浏览器中确认代码——播放器会自动察觉',
