    'Lyrics are matched by the track title, and a YouTube headline sometimes misses. Type the nickname of the artist and the title of the song the way they are written in the lyrics database and pick the right record — the player remembers the choice for this track.': '歌词按曲目标题匹配，而 YouTube 的标题有时对不上。请按歌词数据库中的写法输入艺人名和歌曲名，并选择正确的条目——播放器会为这首曲目记住你的选择。',
    'Pick any request to /youtubei/v1/…, copy all of its request headers and paste them below. The Cookie line must be there.': '选择任意一个发往 /youtubei/v1/… 的请求，复制它的全部请求头并粘贴到下方。必须包含 Cookie 这一行。',
    'Press Sign in with Google: the player shows a short code and a link. Open the link in your browser, sign in to the Google account you use for YouTube Music and type the code.': '点击“使用 Google 登录”：播放器会显示一个短代码和一个链接。在浏览器中打开链接，登录你在 YouTube Music 使用的 Google 账号并输入代码。',
    'Same hand, no doodles in the margins': '同样的笔触，页边没有涂鸦',
    'The player does not need its own client: the built-in one works. Fill these fields only if you want to sign in through your own Google Cloud project.': '播放器不需要自己的客户端：内置的即可使用。只有当你想通过自己的 Google Cloud 项目登录时才需要填写这些字段。',
    'The player stays above other windows': '播放器保持在其他窗口之上',
    'The sure way: paste the cookies by hand': '最可靠的方法：手动粘贴 Cookie',
    'Transport buttons, like, add and the timing row on the player screen. The progress bar stays either way': '播放器界面上的播放按钮、喜欢、添加和歌词校准行。进度条始终保留',
    'no sign-in cookie': '没有登录 Cookie',
    'no sign-in cookie — the wall may stay': '没有登录 Cookie——验证可能仍会出现',
    'pick the browser you are signed in to YouTube with — the player reads the cookies from it by itself.': '选择你登录了 YouTube 的浏览器——播放器会自动从中读取 Cookie。',
    'Tip: sign in to YouTube in a private (incognito) window, export from it and close the window. In an ordinary tab YouTube keeps replacing the cookies, and the exported ones stop working («The page needs to be reloaded»).': '提示：在隐私（无痕）窗口中登录 YouTube，从该窗口导出后关闭窗口。在普通标签页中 YouTube 会不断更换 Cookie，导出的 Cookie 就会失效（“The page needs to be reloaded”）。',
    'YouTube sometimes asks the player to confirm it is not a bot, and then a track or a clip does not start.': 'YouTube 有时会要求播放器确认自己不是机器人，此时曲目或视频无法开始。',
    'Important: the cookies must be of the YouTube website itself': '重要：Cookie 必须来自 YouTube 网站本身',
    'While the YouTube tab is open, click the extension icon and press Export (or Copy) — it exports the cookies of the current site only. Cookies of Google search, Gmail or any other site will not work.': '在 YouTube 标签页打开时，点击扩展图标并选择 Export（或 Copy）——只会导出当前网站的 Cookie。Google 搜索、Gmail 或其他网站的 Cookie 无效。',
    'Paste what you got into the field below. The player checks it right away; then press Save.': '将得到的内容粘贴到下方字段中。播放器会立即检查；然后点击“保存”。',
    'the player reads the cookies from the browser you are signed in with. Close that browser before playing: it may lock its own cookie file.': '播放器会从你已登录的浏览器读取 Cookie。播放前请关闭该浏览器：它可能会锁定自己的 Cookie 文件。',
    'These are not YouTube cookies': '这些不是 YouTube 的 Cookie',
