    'Very few cookies — this looks like a partial export': 'Cookie 太少——看起来像是不完整的导出',
    'Cookies of other sites are ignored and will not be saved': '其他网站的 Cookie 会被忽略，不会保存',
    'These cookies will not help — see the check below': '这些 Cookie 没有帮助——请查看下方的检查结果',
    'Maximize': '最大化',
    'Sign in': '登录',
    'needed by the player': '播放器需要',
    'If YouTube blocks a stream, the app retries other player clients and browser cookies': '如果 YouTube 阻止了音频流，应用会尝试其他播放器客户端和浏览器 Cookie',
    'Take cookies from a browser': '从浏览器获取 Cookie',
    'Neon player without lyrics: cycle through all colours, take them from the cover or use the theme accent': '无歌词的霓虹播放器：轮换所有颜色、取自封面或使用主题强调色',
    'paste the cookies by hand. In your browser open youtube.com while signed in, export the cookies with any “cookies.txt” extension (or copy the whole': '手动粘贴 Cookie。在浏览器中以登录状态打开 youtube.com，用任意 “cookies.txt” 扩展导出 Cookie（或完整复制',
    'Close that browser before playing: it may lock its own cookie file': '播放前请关闭该浏览器：它可能会锁定自己的 Cookie 文件',
    'Export the cookies with any cookies.txt extension, or copy the whole Cookie request header from F12 → Network.': '使用任意 cookies.txt 扩展导出 Cookie，或从 F12 → Network 中完整复制 Cookie 请求头。',
    'Export writes the whole look into one small file: palette, correction, drawn layer, wallpaper and your CSS. Send it to a friend — Import loads it back exactly.': '导出会把整套外观写入一个小文件：调色板、色彩校正、手绘图层、壁纸和你的 CSS。发给朋友——导入后会完全一致地还原。',
    'Picture in picture is not available': '画中画不可用',
